<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFA seeks 60,000 tonnes of soymeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFA seeks 60,000 tonnes of soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Feed Association (KFA) on Tuesday invited tenders to buy 60,000 tonnes of soymeal for arrival by May 30, traders said.</p>
<p>Traders said the tenders were split into two positions, each 30,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Details for the tenders are as follows:</p>
<p>    POSITION   TONNE    ETA     ARRIVAL PORT</p>
<p>     One	30,000   May 30     Inchon</p>
<p>     Two	30,000   May 30   Ulsan and Kunsan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
